  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \n  \nCaptionHostImpl is created with mojo::MakeSelfOwnedReceiver, and it holds a raw pointer to the RenderFrameHost without observing its lifetime.  \n  \nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/master:chrome/browser/accessibility/caption_host_impl.cc;drc=2903761"
